SUMMARY:ICONS 2026 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:ACM International Conference on Neuromorphic Systems\nStatus: c
 onfirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https://iconsneuromorphic
 .cc/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#icons-2026\nNot
 es: Official pages confirm ICONS 2026 on Aug 4-6\, 2026 at the Chicago Ma
 rriott Naperville (Chicago area)\, with virtual registration\; each proce
 edings paper needs an in-person registration. Papers were due Apr 8 AoE (
 the site strikes Apr 1\; EasyChair still lists Apr 1)\; rejected papers m
 ay become posters. Proceedings are ACM DL open access (ACM Open or APC). 
 Tutorial and special-session proposals were organiser routes outside the 
 proceedings. The students-only poster form gave no hour or publication. S
 ize basis is about 40 single-track paper talks and 9 accepted posters in 
 2026\, and 175 participants with 29 papers at the virtual 2021 edition (O
 RNL). The students-only poster competition is schedule-only\, like other 
 student-only routes. Size is an editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Neuromorphic & Brain-inspired Computing,ML Systems & Infrastruct
 ure,Machine Learning
URL:https://iconsneuromorphic.cc/
